sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant Page as React page
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as Background worker
    participant Judge as Judge0
    participant RAG as RAG index
    Student->>Page: Submit C code
    Page->>API: POST assignment submissions + request ID
    API->>DB: Check owner and version, save submission once
    API-->>Page: 202 with submission ID
    Worker->>DB: Claim pending job
    Worker->>Judge: C code with approved test template
    Judge-->>Worker: Execution token
    loop Until runner finishes
        Worker->>Judge: Read execution result
        Judge-->>Worker: Queued, running, or final result
    end
    alt Service failure
        Worker->>DB: Retryable service error, no learning penalty
    else Tests fail
        Worker->>DB: Save safe failure result
    else All required checks pass
        Worker->>DB: Save success and first-completion reward together
        opt Passing version is an enabled LLM trial
            Worker->>DB: Promote exact version once
            Worker->>RAG: Queue embedding and indexing
        end
    end
    loop Page polls while pending
        Page->>API: GET submission by ID
        API->>DB: Read own submission
        DB-->>API: Current result
        API-->>Page: Safe progress or final result
    end
    Page-->>Student: Result and earned progress
    Note over Student,Page: Vote after a finished attempt, report at any time
